<title>USA: U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. barley major sales activity in the week ended Oct 3 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:     1996/97		 1997/98</p>
<p>UK		  8,900		    Nil</p>
<p>Ireland	   2,500</p>
<p>Sales of 11,400 tonnes were two-thirds below the previous week and 53 percent below the four-week average.</p>
<p>Exports of 15,600 tonnes were down 37 percent from the previous week and 57 percent below the four-week average.</p>
<p>Major export destinations were United Kingdom (8,900), Mexifco (4,200) and Ireland (2,500).</p>
</text>
